  m_text: "Alslaam Alaikum, \n\nDear Brother, How is your            doing? I\u2019ve
    been thinking about her and hoping that her condition is stable or, hopefully,
    improving. Please give her my regards. I wanted to let you know that he\u2019s
    planning a business trip from            to             .\nI believe this could
    be the ideal moment to reclaim what\u2019s rightfully ours and honor our       
    . Do you think it\u2019s time to move forward with the plan?\n\n-Yours truly,
    Mona"
