  m_text: "\nFound alongside earlier letters, this message from Saleh echoes Mona\u2019s
    wording, mentioning \u201Cnecessary items\u201D and a plan to act upon arrival
    in Al Madina.\nThe tone is personal yet purposeful. Details remain vague, but
    the coordination is clear. Further context is needed to understand their intent.\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
