  m_text: "\nThis letter was found in a private file and appears to be written by
    someone named Mona to her brother. It discusses a family matter involving their
    mother\u2019s health and mentions someone planning a business trip from Damascus
    to Madina.\nThe writer hints at an opportunity to act on something related to
    their father and refers to a plan that the brother may be involved in. The exact
    nature of the plan is unclear.\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7153e6ed7e58d764faad615d0950e973, type: 2}
