  m_text: "\nFound inside a bag belonging to Ramy, this letter is signed by someone
    named Saleh and addressed to his \u201Csister.\u201D It mentions a plan tied
    to the Damascus\u2013Madina trip and refers to a fake identity now being ready.\nThe
    exact nature of the plan is unclear, but the tone suggests urgency and secrecy.
    The connection between Ramy and Saleh warrants further investigation.\n"
